get="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://hachyderm.io/@kevinrenskers/114308702275578978&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;其它类似工具有 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1405" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;RSS-lambda&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1279" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Feed Filter Maker&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/223" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;siftRSS&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/716" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Grepfeed&lt;/a&gt; 等&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/WEhQIGJW4YnSnIvtmvAQjnQ1wEqQAGRFIGPkvQhcO8by7O6mHKzV0iDG_2YTji4XPDfAOBz02QkcCEEw3z8h6RJ84MBphLoAO9wgE8nwNkbjOrgq2ZZnSnHaP_xuwMaHBjAXmVQU7XSGHSlxvzGEgrFqynqRUkCBddtZZ-kpTNuZ3YgnWCFIqPAiY4zecLxrP13UBHUiwYEsGdS6XlDe63L8IvugAU19YDZMcagBikMFC_9qQw4h3yWIei5_aATyljwCDeYCIpbMLXOe79w9LmNysqBmmAkwzIc5dRHg73aDjlYFvKZUmx6ExTU4S-utj-_lH4zyzwdQErew29x4Kg.jpg" width="800" height="252" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1513</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1513</guid><pubDate>Thu, 17 Apr 2025 00:59:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 GitHub Repo 「ALL-about-RSS」 五年了</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;GitHub Repo 「ALL-about-RSS」 五年了&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;五年前的今天，我提交了「&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/536" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;ALL-about-RSS&lt;/a&gt;」的第一条 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/commit/fbb01c3fa2279df9048f23d6cd52e7b04b9daa1c" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;commit&lt;/a&gt;，以彰显 RSS 作为开放规范的多样性和生命力。五年后，该 List 承蒙大家托举，成长为了一个 RSS 玩家的乐土，有开发者来 PR 自己的 RSS 相关作品，有爱好者来纠错补缺，也有&lt;a href="https://rss.tips/#donators" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;捐赠&lt;/a&gt;、加星、关注等各种形式的支持与助力。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://star-history.com/#aboutrss/all-about-rss&amp;amp;Date" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;5K+ &lt;span class="emoji"&gt;⭐️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/forks" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;200+ forks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/aboutrss/all-about-rss/graphs/contributors" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;40+ 位贡献者&lt;/a&gt;，已使 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/pulls" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;PR 序号来到 #100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢各位 RSS 玩家，也欢迎继续群策群力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/jZNnTP40wtfuJG7WWsP-SnJOieew38usfde6EFrryEKyoHP1OkSnRDqrMIaK2nMU5ofN4035x0I7-QX-uAf38RwV5TALrg9DDQqItb7CKsvLYwQLbmwHy_MSpj5wsnXx6otN_wSmb-m77dbQ7-eCTIJAPLYRR8IMcR7o6a5CenGRFrBrF_5Za28-zOuj-PaIhuE03YIfJ2VUU2FO3PVF79x0vfdkrScePnBQBeCu91fQpN7WHyaufI7v3ajlBE8MVXg7RCqjQ3zS4M4FUnCHqFMvB05W0T8cB1vRibULd_3HbxJ3TYpyfXJ2ABfGm6cxCCo1Anywr4QoqAXN5t7RWg.jpg" width="800" height="460" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1512</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1512</guid><pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 01:01:16 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 Fread: 一个支持 RSS 订阅的 Mastodon/Bluesky 客户端</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fread: 一个支持 RSS 订阅的 Mastodon/Bluesky 客户端&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;该 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1511?q=%23Android"&gt;#Android&lt;/a&gt; App 免费，主打长毛象客户端，但也支持订阅 RSS 和 Bluesky，意味着可以构建多渠道的混合 Feed 流。上线于 24 年夏天。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;官网：&lt;a href="https://fread.xyz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://fread.xyz/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;作者自荐：&lt;a href="https://medium.com/@kezhang404/fread-the-next-generation-mastodon-client-30bc50e279fd" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://medium.com/@kezhang404/fread-the-next-generation-mastodon-client-30bc50e279fd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于作者推文：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://x.com/zhangke19/status/1909825627504755112" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://x.com/zhangke19/status/1909825627504755112&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/pbAGa9_8RmLmwuml9mFXfsh6tu9qN3OwX7SW0z1oRJk4y6ezG4uw-nHyeMY3qfmuhy65e55ujH5-ADNhusgWE4O-OUWkcXbd1AmtBJYjiz9kqV8cuM55yLqqnwC7Q90RE7nwsjiOTgqoN2qQx-jmGwMtobfR91744O51SDzRxXMKH548RmH9NeXv_eOO8n3eImS7sLWtwYEyh-AC74UDhBGqakkx48CeTQIhBRcSRRkBM2OdUFnZkNN7OVau0_M0Yma5ZZbOd3AZ7oi56OQgrLcVZ5tEBLaWq9CODzHSvFseTIAVHbE4t-wXJI1NgXLLGtad4y908ubP-Y44ky2IzQ.jpg" width="800" height="285" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1511</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1511</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Apr 2025 12:02:50 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 MastoLink2RSS : 一个将 #Mastodon 时间线中的 url 抽取出来制成 RSS feed 的 工具</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;MastoLink2RSS : 一个将 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1510?q=%23Mastodon"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#Mastodon&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; 时间线中的 url 抽取出来制成 RSS feed 的 工具&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;频道提及过数个为社交媒体时间线中的链接创建 RSS Feed 的工具（&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/377" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/628" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1080" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;），都没活下来。Twitter/X 的那些可能是因为受限于封闭平台，希望 Fediverse 且 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1510?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&g